The `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0`, and the rejection confirms that a component can't import anything else. I've dropped the `http-client` import and the enrichment call. Adding the grant would take a change to this node's `with` clause in the graph spec, not just to these files. Sending the customer's question to an external host would also be a data-egress decision for the platform team to make explicitly.

